  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given two integers NNN and SSS.\n\nFind any array A=[A1,A2,…,AN]A = [A_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_N]A=[A1​,A2​,…,AN​] of length NNN such that:\n\n\nEach AiA_iAi​ is a **positive** integer.\nThe sum of the array is SSS, i.e, A1+A2+…+AN=SA_1 + A_2 + \\ldots + A_N = SA1​+A2​+…+AN​=S.\nThe bitwise XOR of the array is 000, i.e, A1⊕A2⊕…⊕AN=0A_1\\oplus A_2\\oplus\\ldots\\oplus A_N = 0A1​⊕A2​⊕…⊕AN​=0.\nIf multiple valid arrays exist, you can find any of them.\n\nIf no valid array exists, print −1-1−1 instead.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nThe first and only line of each test case contains two space-separated integers NNN and SSS — the length of the array and the desired sum.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case:\n\n\n\nIf no valid array exists, output a single line containing the integer −1-1−1.\nOtherwise output NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​ denoting the array you found.\n\nIf multiple possible valid arrays exist, you may print any of them.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\leq T \\leq 10^51≤T≤105",
      "1≤N≤2⋅1051 \\leq N \\leq 2\\cdot 10^51≤N≤2⋅105",
      "1≤S≤1091 \\leq S \\leq 10^91≤S≤109",
      "The sum of NNN over all test cases won't exceed 2⋅1052\\cdot 10^52⋅105."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "4\n4 30\n3 14\n2 5\n5 64",
        "output": "7 1 10 12\n5 3 6\n-1\n5 7 24 9 19",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: Consider the array A=[7,1,10,12]A = [7, 1, 10, 12]A=[7,1,10,12]. The sum of this array is 7+1+10+12=307+1+10+12 = 307+1+10+12=30, and its bitwise XOR is 7⊕1⊕10⊕12=07\\oplus 1\\oplus 10\\oplus 12 = 07⊕1⊕10⊕12=0, as required.\nTest case 222: Consider the array A=[5,3,6]A = [5, 3, 6]A=[5,3,6]. The sum of this array is 5+3+6=145+3+6=145+3+6=14, and its bitwise XOR is 5⊕3⊕6=05\\oplus 3\\oplus 6 = 05⊕3⊕6=0, as required.\nTest case 333: No valid array of length 222, sum 555, and XOR 000 exists."
      }
    ]
  },
